# /model while a turn streams: upstream's `Next turn will use`.
models models.json
gateway slow-line-turn.json
fx: seed model-seed-fx.json
xfx: seed model-seed-xfx.json
nomodel
wait 2.5
type say something
key Enter
held
type /model grok
wait 0.5
key Escape
wait 0.4
key Enter
wait 0.8
snap during
release
wait 7
snap after
home end
